          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.147,
            0.883,
            0.205
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. We checked by construction that there are no triangles having sidelengths 3 cm, 4 cm and 8 cm; and 2 cm, 3 cm and 6 cm. Check if you could have found this without trying to construct the triangle.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.206,
            0.878,
            0.265
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Here sum of the two sides (i.e 3 cm and 4 cm) is less than the third side (i.e 8 cm). Similarly for sides of lengths 2cm, 3cm and 6cm, 2 + 3 < 6. So, in both cases triangles are not possible."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.278,
            0.882,
            0.316
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Can we say anything about the existence of a triangle for each of the following sets of lengths?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.324,
            0.169,
            0.34
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.36,
            0.448,
            0.378
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(a) 10 km, 10 km and 25 km",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.385,
            0.458,
            0.403
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " A triangle does not exist"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.428,
            0.458,
            0.445
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(b) 5 mm, 10 mm and 20 mm",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.453,
            0.458,
            0.471
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " A triangle does not exist"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.496,
            0.44,
            0.514
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(c) 12 cm, 20 cm and 40 cm",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.52,
